---
description: "Python style for smart-okf — ruff, mypy, Pydantic patterns"
globs: ["**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---

Read [`PYTHON_STANDARDS.md`](../../PYTHON_STANDARDS.md) and [`rules/common/python-style.md`](../../rules/common/python-style.md).

- Line length 120, ruff format, mypy strict
- Constants in `app/constants.py`; services in `app/services/`
- `str | None`, typed exceptions, `model_copy` for Pydantic
- Verify: `uv run ruff check . && uv run mypy app scripts tests && uv run pytest -q`